sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Script (evil.com)
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as bank.com

    S->>B: <img src="https://bank.com/photo.jpg">
    B->>N: GET /photo.jpg  (Cookie: session=…)
    N-->>B: 200 OK, image bytes
    B-->>S: ✅ rendered on screen
    Note over B: Bytes sind im browser,<br/>aber nicht beim Script
    S->>B: drawImage() onto <canvas>
    B-->>S: canvas now TAINTED
    S->>B: getImageData() / toDataURL()
    B-->>S: ❌ SecurityError — SOP blockiert den read
